msgstr "https://wpml.org/"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Prevents internal links from ever breaking | <a href=\"https://wpml.org"
"\">Documentation</a> | <a href=\"https://wpml.org/version/sticky-links-1-5-4/"
"\">WPML Sticky Links 1.5.4 release notes</a>"
msgstr ""
"از قطع شدن لینک های داخلی جلوگیری می کند |  <a href=\"https://wpml.org\"> "
"مستندات </a> | <a href=\"https://wpml.org/version/sticky-links-1-5-4/\"> "
"یادداشت های انتشار 1.5.4 WPML Sticky Links </a>"

